AQSNr4MWWPUeufWxUjZXBfs-pYj-jZYJyF7-Y8PAt4c-fg&oe=6AFB1DB7"}, {"file_name": "ed roland.png", "id": "1047067571263658", "uri": "https://scontent-lga3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499312454_1047067574596991_3545592460762382153_n.png?_nc_cat=109&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=o5xL_MbUQLUQ7kNvwH4BWFg&_nc_oc=AdrgteRvSPaoyHr3-szNBs9_Gx5uz4yGGNVLgQbahFyML6KfVV_9UA2FD2hINULLPoQ&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQTQSRkeEWhwUm_pJdMH5VaInQLLNZnHdLyr1jzH2lp40A&oe=6AFB4507"}, {"file_name": "1.png", "id": "1592824024803033", "uri": "https://scontent-lga3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974593_1592824028136366_2785707857221777252_n.png?_nc_cat=107&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=OPUMS2lSaK0Q7kNvwEMuQCY&_nc_oc=AdpfoG4AAJHGZSEq59R-GM3MhkjxPtZGDfL77UAOgdN7cEDubk8Z34CdIPLkYo0QHig&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQSozSVpXpXzMvxBcRpokqXrIRJs_OxXUbdiB4mteHF-dQ&oe=6AFB2ED7"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "splash_16-9.png", "id": "1819072665376918", "uri": "https://scontent-lga3-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491828816_1819072668710251_7353430703769565817_n.png?_nc_cat=103&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Ue3kqc3gvOIQ7kNvwG6Hddn&_nc_oc=AdqPDd1BdR7piCTJAFpmILM-_bzaTt8u6YOKaIGQWZlljpMAwh7R5V3zYtmHhgGN_ak&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQTEIu9K6O84LwdcIgsNNnN_J632pyWm7r4H-JGmJ6XWLQ&oe=6AFB25CF"}, "display_name": "Soapbox - Live Performers In Your House", "keywords": ["hologram", "comedy", "music", "lineup", "concert"], "long_description": "Soapbox puts life-size holograms of real musicians and comedians in your living room. Walk around them. They are volumetric captures of the actual people - not avatars, not CGI, not 360 video.\n\nBuild an Instant House Show: pick a lineup, queue performances back to back, and watch them appear in mixed reality (passthrough, in your room) or in a full VR venue.\n\nThe catalog includes T-Pain, Buddy Guy, Yelawolf, Soulja Boy, Jim Jones, Waka Flocka Flame, Norma Jean, Tank, and more. Plus stand-up you can put in the same lineup.\n\nFree to download and explore. Unlock premier performances with one-off purchases or a monthly or yearly subscription.\n\nSoapbox is the only way to have your favorite artists appear life-size in your space.", "short_description": "New users get 3 days free!\n\nLife-size holograms of real musicians and comedians in your living room. Build an Instant House Show: pick a lineup, queue performances, and watch them appear in mixed reality or a full VR venue. No avatars - volumetric captures of the actual artists. \n\nFree to download, with a catalog you can explore."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "splash_portrait.png", "id": "1770420413866405", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_PORTRAIT", "uri": "https://scontent-lga3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491827063_1770420417199738_9163659578469219972_n.png?_nc_cat=104&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=3Zb-QQpd2QIQ7kNvwG5z3_Q&_nc_oc=AdrYE49XB1y_S70JGnRrDx1aldQ_6gJ8kzif-zBCrRF12jvuSPjNr6tvA68lbJtBBUo&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQRxva-vzFeugyUBI-5zzs9zXQuIsTAOrksM98yDYgyfaw&oe=6AFB2F35"}, {"file_name": "splash_square.png", "id": "1433199797716384", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_SQUARE", "uri": "https://scontent-lga3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499300910_1433199801049717_1165102973676556133_n.png?_nc_cat=105&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=3nK8GCD8UEMQ7kNvwEGpmLr&_nc_oc=AdrYx5hjAU27MD25FMFkkYAq8CHfeoVtp1DR2CeodWBqgWIj1y5qWov6EUNrSVLd3NM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQS2cDSJaOK1_1Vnz1xcNJj1NxCE841v3KO9VA9t7-NL3Q&oe=6AFB2885"}, {"file_name": "meta banner.png", "id": "1408416804241288", "image_type": "APP_IMG_HERO", "uri": "https://scontent-lga3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499305071_1408416807574621_5283805827554035897_n.png?_nc_ca